  "name": "BB2025 Matched Play",
  "ruleset": "bb2025-default",
  "description": "BB2025 matched play (the core rules' Matched Play section): a 1,150,000 gold team draft, at least 11 players, inducements and sideline staff bought on the draft list (no free Dedicated Fans), no advancement between games. Four tiers get 6, 8, 9 or 10 Skill Points and 1, 2, 3 or 4 Secondary skills: a Primary skill costs 1 SP, a Secondary 2 SP, one added skill per player, each Elite skill at most 4 times. Star Players cost their gold plus 2 SP (a Mega-star 4 SP, at most one): Tier 1 may hire 1, Tiers 2-4 up to 2, and a hired pair counts as one pick. Purchased skills add no value.",
  "dataNote": "Sources: bloodbowlbase.ru BB2025 core rules, Matched Play section, and its Latest FAQ (Team Tiers May 2026, Mega-stars), read 2026-11-02; cross-checked with the Games Workshop team tiers PDF dated October 2025 (assets.warhammer-community.com) and the repo's BB2025 dataset. Tiers follow May 2026; the October 2025 PDF had Dwarf in Tier 1 (May 2026 lists it in Tier 2). Hand-check: 1. The rules leave the budget to the event (1,100,000 / 1,150,000 / 1,200,000 are common): this card uses 1,150,000; duplicate it to change. 2. Unspent gold is lost. 3. Slann is not on the May 2026 tier list and is left out.",
